<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Russvisa</title></head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:24px 12px; background:#f6f7fb; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#111827;">
  <div style="max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; line-height:1.6; font-size:15px;">
    <p style="margin-top:0;">Hello,</p>
    <p>According to our records, your travel to the Russian Federation is scheduled to begin in just a few days<% if @invitation.arrival_on %> (<b><%= @invitation.arrival_on.strftime('%d.%m.%Y') %></b>)<% end %>.</p>
    <p>To ensure everything goes smoothly with your journey, could you please confirm your current status?</p>
    <ol>
      <li><b>Have you already received your visa?</b></li>
      <li><b>Will your planned trip take place exactly as scheduled?</b></li>
    </ol>
    <p>If your travel dates have changed or if you need any last-minute assistance from our team (such as
      <a href="<%= site_link('/insurance', ref: @invitation.verify_token) %>">local medical insurance</a>,
      a <a href="<%= site_link('/airport-transfer', ref: @invitation.verify_token) %>">VIP airport meeting in Moscow</a>
      or registration guidance), please let us know by replying directly to this email.</p>
    <p>We wish you a safe and pleasant journey!</p>
    <p>Best regards,<br>Russvisa Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
